{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "孩子乱发脾气时的生理机制", "content": "当孩子乱发脾气时，是因为他们还没有能力理解、表达和处理自己当前所面临的情况或情绪。这时下丘脑立刻处于被刺激的状态，使身体释放出大量的压力荷尔蒙（stress hormone），导致孩子出现3F状态（freeze、flight or fight）。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["发脾气", "下丘脑", "压力荷尔蒙", "3F状态"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-fb338e0a34b6-c001:a003", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-fb338e0a34b6", "blocks": ["b00008"], "source_kind": "B"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-fb338e0a34b6-c001:a004", "kind": "supports", "condition": null, "reason": "a004 用成年人例子说明 3F 状态对大脑功能的影响，支持 a003 中孩子发脾气时进入 3F 状态的机制。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-fb338e0a34b6-c001:a005", "kind": "supports", "condition": null, "reason": "a005 基于 a003 的生理机制得出结论：孩子发脾气是生理需求而非矫情。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-fb338e0a34b6-c001:v2-n001", "kind": "complements", "condition": "孩子乱发脾气时", "reason": "source 指出先情绪联结后引导；candidate 解释孩子发脾气时的生理机制（下丘脑刺激、3F状态），补充了为什么需要先联结而不能直接引导的依据。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-fb338e0a34b6-c001:u003"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "3F状态对大脑功能的影响", "content": "任何人包括成年人一旦进入3F状态，大脑都无法正常运行。例如，当觉得老板不满或咄咄逼人、有很多双眼睛盯着时，会越着急越容易出错；很多人想方设法避免公共演讲；一紧张脑子就一片空白。这些都是因为压力荷尔蒙带我们进入了3F状态。研究证明，一个智商正常的成年人，在3F状态下，甚至没有办法独立完成两位数以上的加法。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["3F状态", "压力反应", "认知功能"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-fb338e0a34b6-c001:a004", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-fb338e0a34b6", "blocks": ["b00010"], "source_kind": "B"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-fb338e0a34b6-c001:a003", "kind": "supports", "condition": "", "evidence": "source_extraction"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-fb338e0a34b6-c001:u004"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
